    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρακ-τήρ</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηκτήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>doer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηκτῆρά τε ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.443
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <i>traders,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτάων, οἵ τε πρηκτῆρες ἔασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.162
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίδων π.</span>”
				<i>dealers in . . ,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					6.447
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
